<title>NETHERLANDS: Royal Dutch firm in early Amsterdam.</title>
<headline>Royal Dutch firm in early Amsterdam.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Royal Dutch were marginally higher on Monday, trading 0.80 guilders up at 283.00 amid a generally weaker Amsterdam bourse after weekend reports it was planning a bid for British Gas.</p>
<p>The companies declined to comment on the report in Britain's Sunday Telegraph which said the Anglo-Dutch oil giant had approached British Gas with plans for a 40 billion stg merger.</p>
<p>Dealers in Amsterdam on Monday were sceptical.</p>
<p>&quot;These sort of rumours surface from time to time but I don't think the market gives them much credibility,&quot; one said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
